                  >
                    <path
                      d="M6.2253 4.81108C5.83477 4.42056 5.20161 4.42056 4.81108 4.81108C4.42056 5.20161 4.42056 5.83477 4.81108 6.2253L10.5858 12L4.81114 17.7747C4.42062 18.1652 4.42062 18.7984 4.81114 19.1889C5.20167 19.5794 5.83483 19.5794 6.22535 19.1889L12 13.4142L17.7747 19.1889C18.1652 19.5794 18.7984 19.5794 19.1889 19.1889C19.5794 18.7984 19.5794 18.1652 19.1889 17.7747L13.4142 12L19.189 6.2253C19.5795 5.83477 19.5795 5.20161 19.189 4.81108C18.7985 4.42056 18.1653 4.42056 17.7748 4.81108L12 10.5858L6.2253 4.81108Z"
                      fill="currentColor"
                    />
                  </svg>
                </span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div
              class="_modalBody_a024cf modal-body"
            >
              <div
                class="_modalContent_d58619"
              >
                <p
                  class="mb-2"
                >
                  By participating in any of the featured missions organized by our space exploration team, you acknowledge and agree to the following terms:
                </p>
                <ol>
                  <li
                    class="mb-2"
                  >
                    <strong>
                      Assumption of Risk
                    </strong>
                    <span>
                      : You understand that space missions involve inherent risks, including but not limited to physical injury, psychological stress, and potential loss of life. You voluntarily assume all such risks associated with participation.
                    </span>
                  </li>
                  <li
                    class="mb-2"
                  >
                    <strong>
                      Release of Liability
                    </strong>
                    <span>
                      : You hereby release and hold harmless our organization, its affiliates, officers, employees, and agents from any and all claims, demands, or causes of action arising out of or related to any loss, damage, or injury, including death, that may be sustained by you while participating in the missions.
                    </span>
                  </li>
                  <li
                    class="mb-2"
                  >
                    <strong>
                      Medical Fitness
                    </strong>
                    <span>
                      : You certify that you are in good health and have no medical conditions that would prevent you from safely participating in the missions. You agree to undergo any necessary medical examinations and provide truthful information regarding your health.
                    </span>
                  </li>
                  <li
                    class="mb-2"
                  >
                    <strong>
                      Compliance with Instructions
                    </strong>
                    <span>
                      : You agree to follow all instructions and safety guidelines provided by our team. Failure to comply with these instructions may result in your removal from the mission and forfeiture of any fees paid.
                    </span>
                  </li>
                  <li
                    class="mb-2"
                  >
                    <strong>
                      Use of Likeness
                    </strong>
                    <span>
                      : You grant our organization the right to use your name, likeness, and any photographs or videos taken during the missions for promotional and educational purposes.
                    </span>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    <strong>
                      Governing Law
                    </strong>
                    <span>
                      : This waiver shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction in which our organization is based.
                    </span>
                  </li>
                </ol>
                <p
                  class="mt-2"
                >
                  By clicking "Accept and Join Mission" below, you acknowledge that you have read and understood this waiver of liability and agree to its terms.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div
              class="_footer_a024cf modal-footer"
            >
